 "可直接复制使用，建议粘到项目后在浏览器实测微调；本工具只生成不托管。": "Yes, copy it straight into your project — testing and fine-tuning in the browser is recommended. This tool only generates; it does not host anything.",
 "结果以浏览器实时计算为准，纯前端本地处理、数据不上传；生成的样式与代码仅作快速产出参考，正式项目请以设计系统、规范与浏览器实测为准。": "Results come from real-time in-browser computation: everything is processed locally and nothing is uploaded. Generated styles and code are quick starting points — for production work, defer to your design system, standards and browser testing.",
 "⚠️ 本工具仅供传统文化学习与娱乐参考，所有结果由固定规则或随机模拟得出，不含任何科学断言，不构成风水、命理、算命或决策建议。请理性看待。": "⚠️ This tool is for learning about traditional culture and for entertainment only. All results come from fixed rules or random simulation with no scientific claim, and do not constitute feng shui, fortune-telling or decision-making advice. Please treat them accordingly.",
 "个人或家庭的理财规划、贷款与投资收益测算、日常收支与税务估算。": "Personal and household financial planning, loan and investment return calculations, plus everyday budgeting and tax estimates.",
 "设计稿标注、配色与排版相关的快速参考。": "Quick references for design annotations, color schemes and typography.",
 "实验设计、样本量与科研数据的快速估算。": "Quick estimates for experimental design, sample sizes and research data.",
 "报告可用性：三项全合格方可用于验收": "Report usability: all three checks must pass before the report can be accepted.",
 "处理大图会卡吗？": "Will large images slow it down?",
